{"title": "Status properties/DisableImmunityOverhead", "pageid": 35226, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Status_properties/DisableImmunityOverhead", "categories": ["Status properties"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">See also <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">Status properties</a>.</div>\n<p><b>DisableImmunityOverhead</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Status_property\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status property\">status property</a>. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"List_of_conditions_with_DisableImmunityOverhead\">List of conditions with DisableImmunityOverhead</span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Banished\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Banished_(Condition)\" title=\"Banished (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Banished_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Banished_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Banished_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Banished_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Banished_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Banished_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Banished\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Banished_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Banished_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0d/Banished_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Banished_(Condition)\" title=\"Banished (Condition)\">Banished</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Banished from this plane of existence.</li>\n<li>Can't be targeted.</li>\n<li>Can't move or take <a href=\"/wiki/Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Action\">Actions</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Bonus_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bonus Action\">Bonus Actions</a>, or <a href=\"/wiki/Reaction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction\">Reactions</a></li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Ethereal_Escape\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ethereal_Escape_(Condition)\" title=\"Ethereal Escape (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Banished_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Banished_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Banished_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Banished_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Banished_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Banished_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ethereal Escape\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Banished_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Banished_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0d/Banished_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Ethereal_Escape_(Condition)\" title=\"Ethereal Escape (Condition)\">Ethereal Escape</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>As a <span style=\"display: inline-block; height: 20px; width: 20px; margin-left: -3px; margin-top: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/35px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/46px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Reactions\" title=\"Actions\">Reaction</a> to receiving damage, the incubus has travelled to the Ethereal Plane and can't be damaged or targeted until it returns at the start of its next turn.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202022\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.026 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.028 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 554/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 7892/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1427/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 19/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.002/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 548722/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   22.955      1 Template:Status_property_page\n100.00%   22.955      1 -total\n 51.26%   11.766      2 Template:ConditionsTableRow\n 47.09%   10.809      2 Template:Condition_inline/format\n 45.48%   10.441      2 Template:Icon_link\n 43.81%   10.058      2 Template:Icon_text\n 37.85%    8.689      4 Template:Trim\n 30.22%    6.936      2 Template:Ifempty\n 15.49%    3.556      1 Template:PageSeo\n 14.19%    3.258      1 Template:Hidden_code\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:35226-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202022 and revision id 330627. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}